  "identifier": "openscribe",
  "name": "OpenScribe",
  "description": "Open-source, local-first AI clinical scribe that records patient encounters and automatically generates structured clinical notes. Runs entirely on-device via a desktop Electron app — no audio or patient data leaves the clinic. Uses local LLMs to transcribe and structure notes, providing a privacy-preserving alternative to commercial AI scribes (Nuance DAX, Ambience, Suki) with no vendor lock-in.",
