  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The leading open-source alternative to commercial AI clinical scribes. Local-first Electron app processes audio entirely on-device — no patient data leaves the clinic — a critical differentiator for practices subject to HIPAA, GDPR, or institutional data governance policies. 165 stars and 38 forks within 6 months of launch signals strong community demand. MIT licence, actively maintained. Individual-governed and no peer-reviewed publication yet; Assess pending community growth and clinical validation, but the privacy-preserving design makes it worth evaluating now for any team exploring ambient clinical documentation.",
